  souvenirDescription: "\"It's an antique-looking necklace with beautiful embellishments.
    Inside the necklace is a dried flower petal. Theres a letter written in neat
    handwriting that was attached to the necklace.\r\n\r\n\u201CYou once said the
    night would never end.\r\nBut you were wrong - \r\nIt ends the moment someone
    dares to light a candle.\r\n\r\nYou were my light.\u201D\r\n\r\nAnd on the reverse:\r\n\r\n\u201CLove
    ~\r\nEven when the world forbiddeth it.\r\nFor love alone is the law worth breaking.\u201D"
  souvenirEffectDescription: This old necklace does nothing
